msgid "DataFlash Logs"
msgstr "DataFlash 日志"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/dataflash_logger.rst:9
#: 1e1a4fb09af4489e8d4915e6391bca4f
msgid ""
"This module allows dataflash logs to be streamed in realtime from the "
"autopilot. It requires the ``LOG_BACKEND_TYPE`` parameter to include the "
"\"MAVLink\" backend."
msgstr ""
"该模块允许从飞控实时流式传输 DataFlash 日志。需要 ``LOG_BACKEND_TYPE`` 参数包含 「MAVLink」 后端。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/dataflash_logger.rst:12
#: 19639d8786ce48f4a1e14bff62d9fe33
msgid "The logs will be downloaded to the vehicle logging folder."
msgstr "日志将下载至飞行器日志文件夹。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/dataflash_logger.rst:15
#: b7e9b48c7050473b91ef7176f5ab1c36
msgid "Control"
msgstr "控制"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/dataflash_logger.rst:21
#: 9c53cccb86e74b9ebcff78bf6b6ac46e
msgid ""
"Start streaming dataflash logs. Requires the dataflash logging to be "
"started, typically when the vehicle is armed."
msgstr "开始流式传输 DataFlash 日志。需要先启动 DataFlash 日志记录，通常在飞行器解锁时启动。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/dataflash_logger.rst:28
#: 070470256dc54ab29f579ccd3afb522a
msgid "Stop streaming dataflash logs"
msgstr "停止流式传输 DataFlash 日志"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/dataflash_logger.rst:34
#: 51c0b82c2d5d4ff2bc5e1730a027a1f6
msgid "Print the progress of the dataflash log streaming"
msgstr "打印 DataFlash 日志流式传输进度"

